  "goodToKnow": "Die Biomasse is biomass, organic material such as wood, crops, manure and waste used for energy. Germany has thousands of Biogasanlagen (biogas plants), many fed with maize, which critics say leads to Vermaisung, landscapes dominated by maize monoculture. In ecology, Biomasse also means the total mass of living things in an area. It has no plural."
